-stop short of the pin (from 4 px at L1 to 22 px at L4), full
-wire drops with probability pdrop (up to 0.20 at L4), wrongpin snaps with probability pwp (from 0.02 at L2 to 0.10 at
-L4), and anchor displacement, where with probability pdisp
